@startuml
title Диаграмма последовательности: Обработка команды управления устройством

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Web App" as WebApp
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Device Service" as DeviceService
participant "Device Command Handler" as CommandHandler
participant "Device Validator" as Validator
participant "Device State Manager" as StateManager
participant "Event Publisher" as EventPublisher
participant "IoT Device" as IoTDevice
participant "Message Broker" as Broker
database "Device DB" as DeviceDB
database "Redis Cache" as Redis

User -> WebApp: Включить отопление в гостиной
WebApp -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/devices/heating-living-room/command\n{"action": "turn_on", "temperature": 23}

Gateway -> DeviceService: POST /devices/heating-living-room/command
DeviceService -> CommandHandler: handleCommand(deviceId, command)

CommandHandler -> Validator: validateCommand(command)
Validator -> CommandHandler: CommandValid

CommandHandler -> StateManager: updateDeviceState(deviceId, newState)
StateManager -> DeviceDB: UPDATE device SET state='on', temperature=23
StateManager -> Redis: SET device:heating-living-room:state "on"
StateManager -> CommandHandler: StateUpdated

CommandHandler -> IoTDevice: MQTT: {"device_id": "heating-living-room", "action": "turn_on", "temperature": 23}
IoTDevice -> CommandHandler: MQTT ACK: {"status": "success"}

CommandHandler -> EventPublisher: publishEvent(DeviceStateChanged)
EventPublisher -> Broker: Kafka: DeviceStateChangedEvent
CommandHandler -> DeviceService: CommandExecuted

DeviceService -> Gateway: 200 OK {"status": "success", "device_id": "heating-living-room", "state": "on"}
Gateway -> WebApp: 200 OK
WebApp -> User: Отопление включено

note over Broker
Другие сервисы (Telemetry, Notification) 
получают событие и могут на него реагировать
end note

@enduml